window.products.push({"id":624074,"name":"WODEJIA Bath Rugs Sponge Foam Soft for Bathroom,Flannel Mat Non Slip Bright 3D Printed for Bedside,Clearance MatS Absorbent Moisture Dust Forlaundry R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W2iGJcD8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Note: 1. Our bath mat packaging adopts compressed and vacuum packaging.After receiving the package, open it and see that it is very thin, and the surface of the cushion is covered with wrinkles, which will make you feel that it is very cheap and unsatisfactory. Butyou don't need to worry, you don't need to wash it with water. You can iron the bath mat with a hot hair dryer or stimulating air. The sponge will expand automatically at high temperature to restore the flatness of the cushion. And this will not influence the performance of the bath mat itself.2. When you find that the surface of the floor mat is a little white, it is caused by the fluff and smooth hair when vacuuming. You can solve it by gently touching it in one direction for a few times with your hand. 3. When cleaning the kitchen rug, if you wash it by hand, please note that you can only use a brush to clean it in one direction. Do not use your rub to damage the internal tissue of the sponge, so that the alfombras para baños cannot be restored to level. If you wash it by machine, please use a roller The washing machine can achieve the cleaning effect without damaging the decorations mat. It can be dried directly or air-dried naturally, and the internal tissue of the sponge cannot be damaged by rubbing hard.What is the thickness of the bathroom rug? The natural thickness of the bath carpet is 0.78 inches.This is a multifunctional floor carpet. It is suitable for you to use Flannel rug as bathroom mats, study mats, bedside mats, door mats, shoe tray mats, kitchen mats, laundry mats, barn door mats, office doormats, etc. And so on, it can be used in various occasions and places. There are multiple sizes of the same pattern that can be purchased. Please pay attention to choose the size you need before placing an order to avoid a bad shopping experience and economic loss.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W2iGJcD8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WODEJIA","source_asin":"B0BPX8F8M7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPX8F8M7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPX8F8M7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
