window.products.push({"id":624157,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner for Allergies, Air Choice True HEPA Filter Air Conditioner, Remove 99.97% of Dust Smoke, Odor, and Pet Dander, Ozone Free, Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Quickly Cools Entire Rooms: The Air Choice portable air conditioner has a cooling capacity of 12000 BTU (ASHRAE), making it perfect for quickly cooling rooms up to 550 sq. ft. Whether you're trying to beat the heat in your living room, kitchen, or garage, this portable unit can provide the relief you need. With a temperature range of 62℉(17℃)~86℉(30℃) and an auto-swing function, you can enjoy even, consistent cooling throughout the room. No-Tool Installation: The Air Choice portable air conditioner is designed for easy installation without any special tools required. It's compatible with both hanging and sliding windows that range from 36\" to 50\" in height/length, and comes with all the necessary installation kits in the package. With the 4 ⅞ ft exhaust hose included, you can easily position your air conditioner for maximum comfort. Quiet Cooling for a Better Night's Rest: The Air Choice portable air conditioner is designed to provide quiet cooling for a better night's sleep. With a sleep mode that reduces noise levels, you can rest easy knowing that you won't be disturbed by a noisy air conditioner. Plus, the 24-hour on/off timer allows you to set the unit to turn on before you arrive home, ensuring a cool and refreshing space to welcome you. Moveable AC Unit: The Air Choice portable air conditioner is designed for complete portability. With four 360° wheels and two built-in handles, you can easily move this unit from room to room for instant cooling relief. Plus, the washable filter makes maintenance a breeze, providing a continuous supply of fresh and clean cool air throughout your home. Customizable Comfort with Dual Controls: Enjoy customizable comfort with the Air Choice portable AC cooling unit. With a user-friendly digital control panel and a compact remote control, you can easily adjust the mode, temperature, timer, swing, fan speed, and unit of measurement (℃/℉) to your liking. With dual controls and easy-to-use features, this unit provides the perfect solution for your summer cooling needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air Choice","source_asin":"B07PNL2TGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PNL2TGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PNL2TGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
