window.products.push({"id":624229,"name":"Fiesta 1-Quart Large Bowl, Cinnabar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":157.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XY2CP1DKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Fiesta 1-Quart Large Bowl manufactured by The Homer Laughlin China Company. America's largest domestic producer of dinnerware, and the sole manufacturer of all Fiesta dinnerware. All Fiesta pieces are Microwave safe, Oven-proof, Dishwasher safe, Freezerproof, Lead-Free, and Made in America with the implementation of many green practices. The very durable glaze is great for everyday use. Fiesta as a pattern has stood the test of time, and is typically passed down from one generation to the next. We have kept the pattern constant through the years so that you can count on us to be here when you decide to expand or change your collection. New pieces and colors are added every so often to keep things interesting. Currently, Fiesta is the most collected dinnerware in America. Amazon.com Serve up any side dish that comes along in this sturdy and attractive 1-quart Fiestaware bowl. With subtle ridges and a sturdy lip to prevent spilling, the bowl comes in handy at almost any meal. Fill it with fruit for breakfast, corn chips for lunch, and pasta for dinner. With a raised foot for minimum heat contact underneath, the dish measures 8-1/4 inches in diameter and is 2-1/2 inches deep at its center. It can go from your microwave to your dishwasher--stopping at your table, of course--with no problem. Finished in a cinnabar lead-free glaze, the bowl blends in with other colors of Fiestaware. --Emily Bedard Editor's note: This item is being retired by the manufacturer and its availability may be limited.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XY2CP1DKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homer Laughlin","source_asin":"B00005QXXE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005QXXE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005QXXE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":624230,"name":"Set of 5 Wall Hanging Jute Basket | Round Handwoven Southwestern Decorative Wall Accents - Room Decor Basket for Boho, Scandinavian, Farmhouse Home De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81myIwsunXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUSTIC WALL DECOR ACCENTS - This tray basket is a creative and charming addition to your wall decor collections. Thanks to its beautiful woven patterns and even natural color, the tray set falls in harmony with many styles of decor, adding a nice touch of natural beauty to your home. This wire basket is a great choice for fireplace decor, master bedroom, living room or kitchen decor. EASY TO HANG AND CARE - Thanks to the innovative weaving skills, these baskets are easy to hang on walls with an adhesive hooks or nail. If the jute baskets ever gets dirts, you can simply clean them with a damp cloth and let them dry in an airy space before next use. GOOD FOR HOME - Meticulously made to details, MadeTerra woven wall basket set is free from harmful chemicals, odor or splinters. The colors are lively and vivid, the weaving patterns are flawless. It is an item of premium craftsmanship and natural sound, made to last and benefit your sustainable home for a long time. GOOD FOR MOTHER EARTH - Made Terra wicker trays are made of natural jute, a plant that’s sustainably grown and easy to harvest. For thousands of years, seagrass is widely used by Vietnamese artisans to make home furniture and accessories. This is a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and table serving solution. HANDCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS - Our jute woven round basket, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Kim Son,the base of sedge and seagrass in Vietnam. All of our products are handmade, so the actual pieces may vary slightly in color and size from the images shown online. UNIQUE GIFT: The beautiful seagrass wall decor makes it ideal housewarming gift or perfect Gift for Christmas, Home Decor, New Year, Celebrations for minimalist, natural lovers or those who love cooking and home decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81myIwsunXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B09HZM456L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HZM456L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HZM456L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
