window.products.push({"id":624351,"name":"Sushi Making Kit for Beginners - Easy DIY Sushi Rolling Kit - Sushi Bazooka Kit, Bamboo Mats, and Chopsticks - 20 piece All in One Set Made of Food Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bjIiQNXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our complete sushi making kit is restaurant grade quality using eco friendly materials and with its convenient storage bag helps you to keep your kit all together ready for use at any time. The convenient storage bag also allows you to grab and go to take your kit with you to a friends or family members home, or on your vacation. Ease of use Gone are the days of struggling to make sushi only by hand. Now you have tools and kitchen gadgets to help you along the way. Beginners can, within minutes, enjoy delicious sushi with the ingredients of their choosing, and create perfect rolls like the pros! Host a sushi making party with friends or family and create lasting memories . All can join in the fun with this sushi maker kit. With your new sushi set you will be able to make and enjoy sushi at home for a fraction of the cost you would pay at a sushi restaurant. Now everyone will want to come to your place for fun and good eats. Quality counts The Cisaq bazooka sushi roller kit includes a sharp perforated not stick stainless steel sushi knife helping your cuts to be cleaner. Bazooka is durable and BPA free. Dishwasher safe; however, handwashing is recommended to extend the life of your bazooka. Sustainable and Eco Friendly Sushi rolling mat and chopsticks are 100% natural premium bamboo . Bamboo sushi rolling mat is handmade increasing its quality and durability. Clean with mild soap and water. Handwashing and drying will extend the life of your kit. Sustainability goes beyond just the product itself. Long gone are the days of paper instructions that often get misplaced or lost. You now have instructions at your fingertips on your mobile devices through online instructional videos . Customer focused We want to hear from you. We value customer feedback as it is the best way for us to know how we can better serve you and improve our products for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bjIiQNXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cisaq Kitchen","source_asin":"B08YX72PTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YX72PTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YX72PTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
