window.products.push({"id":624419,"name":"Pullman loaf pan with lid, Bread pans for baking toast mold or sandwich loaf, banana bread or sourdough, bread pan with lid by Oak and Noble GOLD","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A9eRIIWUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want to create a healthy choice for your family? The only way to know WHAT is in your bread is to bake it yourself! Our Pullman loaf pan with lid makes the job easy and fun! Oak and Noble have created five delicious recipes in our beautiful ebook, that you get for FREE , so you can impress your loved ones with freshly baked bread. Our bread pans are designed to make baking fun. Whether it's sweet banana bread or crusty sourdough toast, you can include the whole family in the baking process. The loaf pan is approx 9x5x4.5 inches, making it the perfect size for your kitchen! Pre-Use Care - Before using the Oak and Noble Pullman loaf pan, give it a wash with hot, soapy water and dry it well with a clean cloth. It then needs a quick wipe over with butter or oil on all sides to cure it. Heat your oven to approx 250°F and pop it in for 4-6 minutes. Using an oven mitt, remove the pan, and when cooled wipe the pan over with some paper towel. Washing Care - For best results, please do not use any abrasive cloths to clean the pan. Regular use - After every wash, dry the bread pan in a warmed oven for a few minutes. The folded pan corners retain a few drops of water and need to be completely dried before being stored away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A9eRIIWUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ON.","source_asin":"B08MW7MPJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MW7MPJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MW7MPJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
