window.products.push({"id":624431,"name":"Magnetic Measuring Cups Set Stainless Steel Heavy Duty Metal Measuring Cups for Dry and Liquid Ingredients (black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o+Dpw6QHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[MEASURING CUP SET] The size of the magnetic stainless steel measuring cup set includes 1/8 cup, 1/4 cup, 1/3 cup, 1/2 cup, 2/3 cup, 3/4 cup, and 1 cup. Seven different sizes are used for cooking or baking. [HIGH QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL] This magnetic measuring cup set is made of high-quality stainless steel. The material is sturdy and durable, and the handle will not break easily under your normal use. Easy to clean. The appearance of the measuring cup is polished and smooth, and the color is matte and bright. [MEASURING SCALE] The handle and body of this set of metal measuring cups have scales, which are clear and easy to see. The font is engraved and will not disappear gradually due to long-term use. With this set of accurate measuring tools, you can clearly measure the volume requirements of the ingredients when cooking or baking. [MAGNETIC HANDLE] The cup handle is nested in silicone, which feels comfortable and does not slip or cut your hands. There is also a magnet inside. There is a strong magnetic attraction between the cup handle and the cup handle.The design of the oval concave-convex part on the silicone handle conforms to the common gripping habits, and it feels comfortable and does not slip or cut your hands. The black handles make the whole set of measuring tools look simple and stylish. [EASY TO STORE] This magnetic measuring cup is stackable and easy to store. The bottom of the cup is sleek and it is also equipped with a storage ring. It can be stored flat in your utensil drawer or hung in a place that is convenient for you to take. [USE WIDELY] The magnetic stainless steel measuring cup set can be used for cooking or baking, measuring dry or liquid ingredients, and is also a good choice as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o+Dpw6QHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"X-zrew","source_asin":"B09KLJ9V6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KLJ9V6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KLJ9V6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
