window.products.push({"id":624610,"name":"Tea Kettle - SUSTEAS 3.17QT Whistling Kettle with Ergonomic Handle - Premium Stainless Steel Tea Pots for Stove Top, Chic Vintage Teapot with Composit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WYMeXL0JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【SUSTEAS Classic Design】- Continues the SUSTEAS vintage style and abandons the dull shape of the traditional tea kettle. The whole body is made of superior food-grade 18/8 stainless steel, and the outer wall is sprayed with paint at high temperature, which will not fade for a long time. Compared with other brands, SUSTEAS whistling tea kettle has a longer life cycle, because we are deeply committed to product quality and understand user experience. ✅【Nice Partner In Your Kitchen】- This 3.17-quart tea pots for stove top can satisfy the whole family to make tea (maximum boiling capacity: 2.64 quarts), the whistle will sound as soon as the water is boiled, loud but not harsh, preventing excessive boiling and reducing safety hazards. (🌟🌟Note: Do not touch the teapot body or open the lid when the water is boiling. Make sure to keep the lid closed when working.) ✅【Boil Water Faster | Make Tea Easier】- The 5-layer composite bottom makes the thermal conductivity better and the heating more uniform. The thickened body is built to last, the snap-on lid fits closely with the body of the stainless steel tea kettle, which not only improves the safety of pouring water, but also ensures the proper operation of the whistle. It is compatible with all types of stoves, including induction, gas, electric, halogen and radiant stoves. ✅【Focus On Details | Ingenious Craftsmanship】- This tea pot takes into account the needs of beauty and ease of use. The handle is equipped with a safe and anti-scalding material for a comfortable grip. The easy-to-pour trigger opening mechanism allows you to brew tea with one hand. The tough shape is paired with an old-world-inspired nameplate so you'll always notice it no matter where you put it. ✅【Kitchenware Experts At Your Service】- SUSTEAS teapot looks exquisite and stunning, helping you create a coordinated kitchen for both modern and retro homes. We are dedicated to premium service to help solve any of the problem and stand behind our products with a 1-year warranty. 🌟🌟🌟【MATTERS NEED ATTENTION】- Since our tea kettle stovetop is made of stainless steel, A HIGH FIRE can overheat it and make it impossible to touch directly, and even cause the paint to peel off. To protect the kettle, it is recommended to use low to medium heat when boiling water to ensure a longer lifespan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WYMeXL0JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUSTEAS","source_asin":"B0BFJ1ZYT5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFJ1ZYT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFJ1ZYT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
