window.products.push({"id":624663,"name":"Gunter Wilhelm Executive Chef Series Model 214 6\" Boning/Fillet Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wSqZl76iL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"All Gunter Wilhelm cutlery use top of the line, German forged 440c high carbon stainless steel. This steel keeps an edge longer and stays sharper than other types of steel, while able to be easily sharpened when needed. Gunter Wilhelm’s special heat treatment and ice hardening process allows our steel to be maintained more easily than other top leading brands in the world due to an outstanding 59 on the Rockwell scale (hardness). Also featured is our patented triple tang design in the fully forged handle. We are the first to feature this design, contributing to our exceptional weight and perfectly balanced feel needed for any and every job, from simple home cooking to the most exquisite meals prepared by the top chefs in the world. We are proud to have our knives used by top chefs in the White House, Vice President’s Residence, and Camp David. Chef Guy Mitchell of the White House Chef Tour travels around the country with former and current Navy chefs and exclusively uses our knives for shows, demonstrations, and exhibitions. Maneet Chauhan, of Food Network’s show Chopped, also loves our knives and uses them exclusively in her kitchen. The smallest of our Boning/Fillet knives, this 6\" blade offers dexterity that larger boning knives can't. Its extra thin blade and wide handle allows for absolute control, giving you the power to butterfly, slice, bone, and fillet any cut of meat that comes your way. Comes in protective sleeve. *NOTE* Our nylon protective sheaths are not covered by any warranty. Additional sheaths can be purchased over the phone. Sheaths are meant to protect the blade from damage if stored with other knives. Pictures include images that are examples of the condition of the product. Actual condition may vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wSqZl76iL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gunter Wilhelm","source_asin":"B00D99WP98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D99WP98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D99WP98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":624664,"name":"HAUS AND HUES 16x20 White Picture Frame - Set of 1 16x20 White Frame 16x20, Wooden Picture Frames, White 16x20 Picture Frame White, 16x20 Inch Frame, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aysJYK08L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"16x20 POSTER FRAMES FOR WALL: This 16x20 wood frame is perfect for adding a modern and chic touch to your home. The 16 by 20 picture frame is made from solid oak, a strong and durable hardwood, and is finished in a white color for a contemporary look. The 16x20 picture frame is an excellent size for displaying photos or artwork 16x20 FRAMES MADE TO LAST: The 16x20 poster frame has a slim profile, giving it a minimalistic look. Our 16x20 frame white will look great in a variety of settings, from a living room to a bedroom, and will bring a touch of modern style to your space. The finish on the 16x20 picture frames for wall will match any décor and will be a timeless addition to your home. The solid oak construction makes the picture frames 16x20 lasting and durable pieces, so you can enjoy them for years to come PREMIUM QUALITY: Our thin poster frame will add the finishing touch to your art or photo. It’s equipped with plexiglass covered by protective film and two metal hangers for horizontal or vertical hanging. The light wood frame is shipped in a durable box for protection while in transit SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Our in-house team ensures every 16x20 picture frame order passes our quality inspection to minimize misprints and order defects. We want you to shop our products with confidence, so we offer a hassle-free return and refund guarantee. If you're not satisfied with your purchase, let us know and we'll provide you with a full refund or replacement A THOUGHTFUL GIFT: Our 16x20 frames will make a great gift for friends and family. Give your loved ones this wood picture frame for a birthday, housewarming, graduation, Christmas, or any special occasion","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aysJYK08L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUS AND HUES","source_asin":"B0BNQCRJ8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQCRJ8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQCRJ8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
