window.products.push({"id":624723,"name":"Wusthof Classic 7\" Fillet Knife - Personalized Rotary Engraving Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":135.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DJ7YlUAXL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"This Wusthof knife will be custom engraved using a real diamond tip. This is different, and superior to \"Laser Engraving\". Lasers can not directly engrave pure steel, so laser engraved knives must be treated first with a chemical before \"marking\". The resulting \"marking\" by a laser is flat, and black, and will wear off with time. This engraving is etched directly into the steel, creating a everlasting heirloom, with your choice of text. Engraving on Bolster Only","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DJ7YlUAXL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B07D91PHVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D91PHVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D91PHVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":624724,"name":"Collapsible Reusable Straws,Taste BPA-Free Food grade portable silicone straws,Suitable for 20 and 30 ounce glasses,3 Straight(White blue Pink)+3 Bent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZcACOedjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Specifications Product Name: Reusable Silicone Straws Material: Food-grade Silicone Color: Pink & White & Blue Length: 10 inch Inner Diameter of the Straws: 0.35 Inch Outside Diameter of the Straws: 0.45 Inch   ✅ Package Include 3* Bent Silicone Straw 3* Straight Silicone Straw 1* Cleaning Brush    Why use reusable Silica gel straws?  In daily life, we use a lot of plastic straws every day. According to statistics, 501 million disposable plastic straws will be discarded every day in the US, but it is almost impossible to recycllastic straws.  Plastic straws usually end up in the garbage dump, resulting in thousands of tons of trash will be added to our planet. More seriously, plastics are light, durable, but slow to degrade. A large number of discarded straws flow into the ocean and swallowed by marine organisms. Plastic straws have threatened the survival of marine life.  As an environmentally-friendly company, If you like, we want to know how you feel. Let us know every contribution you make to the environment, thank you.  ✅ WHAT IS BPA?  BPA (bisphenol-A) is a chemical added to many commercial products, first discovered in the 1890s. Chemists realized it could be used to produce resilient polycarbonate plastics. These days, BPA-containing plastics are commonly used in food containers, baby bottles.  ✅ IS BPA BAD FOR YOU?  BPA is said to mimic the structure and function of the hormone estrogen. BPA thus can bind to estrogen receptors and influence growth, cell repair, fetal development, energy levels and reproduction. BPA may also be linked to health issues: Polycystic ovary syndrome (PCOS), Premature delivery, Asthma...  ABS (Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene) is harmless in that it doesn't have any known carcinogens, and there are no known adverse health effects related to exposure to ABS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZcACOedjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decootl","source_asin":"B07YFDWZV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YFDWZV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YFDWZV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":624725,"name":"Brass Metal Garuda Bird Snake Bite Amulet A3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XeHXWTH6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is gorgeous small Brass Garuda amulet from Thailand Garuda is a humanoid bird creature and the mount of lord Vishnu. The Phoenix is considered a modern version of Garuda. It is a popular figure in Thailand and Cambodia. In Indonesia it is the national symbol. In India the Garuda is the enemy of the naga serpent or snake and is regarded as an amulet to protect against snake bites and their poison. Size: 1.1\" tall and 1.2\" wide (2.6 cm tall and 2.7 cm wide) Weight: .32 oz (9.4 gm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XeHXWTH6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Himalayan Treasures","source_asin":"B019ZFUYG0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019ZFUYG0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019ZFUYG0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
