window.products.push({"id":624755,"name":"Insulated Lunch Bag Lightweight Lunch Tote Bag for Women/Men Reusable Lunch Box with Shoulder Strap and Multiple Pockets for Work School Picnic-Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pgnVnPgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Capacity and Multiple Compartments】WinMax lunch box comes with a main compartment to keep your food and drinks warm or fresh. Front zip pocket for keys, cards. Two mesh pockets for water bottles and one inner mesh pocket for knives, forks and spoons. Measuring 8.7 x 5.5 x 7.9 inches (approx. 8.7 x 14 x 7.9 inches (approx. 22.1 x 14 x 20.1 cm) (L x W x H)), it is perfect for packing all your food and snacks. Wear it all day. 【Wide Opening Design】The top of the WinMax lunch bag can be opened 7.9 x 5.5 inches (about 19.9 x 14.9 cm) with a sturdy zipper, you can put the lunch container in the bag and take it out horizontally. The wide opening is designed for easy access, preventing liquids from leaking out of the container and soiling the bag, saving you cleaning time. 【Insulated and easy to clean】Keep Cool or warm for 5 hours and more，Don't worry about your food getting bad due to high temperatures. If you want to clean it, just wipe the inner aluminum foil with a soft cloth and hang it to dry. 【Shoulder Strap Portable】WinMax reusable lunch box has reinforced handle on top and comes with detachable and adjustable shoulder strap, which can be adjusted from 15 inches to 27 inches when carrying, giving you more carrying options. Padded soft shoulder straps ensure a comfortable carry. The modern and lightweight design (only 12 oz) makes it easy to use as a lunch bag, cooler bag, picnic bag, grocery bag or shopping bag. 【Suitable for different occasions】 - Personalized thermos lunch bag insulated will never be out of date！You can take it to the office, go on day trips, beach and sporting, or pack a healthy snack for outdoor activity. Suitable for men and women.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pgnVnPgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"winmax","source_asin":"B07MC9Q8WH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MC9Q8WH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MC9Q8WH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
