window.products.push({"id":624773,"name":"WHITEWRAP Reusable Mesh Bags with Drawstrings | 7\"x10\" Small |6-Pack |Eco Friendly Bags, Food Storage, Natural Cotton, Biodegradable Fabric Bags, Snac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Bn8XqQcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ PREMIUM REUSABLE PRODUCE BAGS: Made of premium 100% Cotton that’s nontoxic and unbleached. Safe to use, soft of touch feeling, durable and reusable. These bags are the perfect choice for carrying & storing heavy bulk items or produce like onions, potatoes, carrots, apples, oranges, bananas, and anything you want! Easily clean and wash them in cold water, then air dry ✅ ECO-FRIENDLY FABRIC BAGS: No more plastic. Use this organic, 100% Biodegradable Cotton fabric bag with a smooth and delicate fabric, which allows for air circulation. Easy to care extra large cloth bags. Natural cotton fabric bags are smooth, which allows for air circulation. Each cotton drawstring bag has the potential to eliminate up to 1000 plastic bags over its lifetime. Live eco-life and save our planet. Your little behavior may save a fish or a turtle from polluted living environment. ✅MULTIPURPOSE: Suited for storing fruits and vegetables in refrigerator, accompanying your reusable grocery bag to the market, packaging crafts, soaps, candles, wedding favors and so on. Simple to pack and close with the drawstring, good for both home and kitchen needs in daily life, utility and beautiful. These are perfect for office and pantry storage. These are the bags that you simply can’t live without. ✅ LIGHT-WEIGHT & TRANSPARENT - They are also time-saving and convenient. Because they're mesh, your produce can be scanned when checking out at the grocery store without removing it from the bag. The mesh material also allows you to leave produce inside the bag for rinsing once you get home and you can pop it straight into the fridge. Air flows through the mesh weave, so your fruit and veggies can breathe and stay fresh longer. ✅100% GUARANTEED: We Promise to Offer Best Quality Products .We will provide you with a No-Questions-Asked replacement or refund. If you encounter any problems about our lightweight cotton reusable mesh produce bags, please send an email to us, we will provide you with a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Bn8XqQcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHITEWRAP","source_asin":"B0B5RL21WV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5RL21WV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5RL21WV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
