window.products.push({"id":624925,"name":"Scorpiuse 2 Pcs L-Shaped Stretch Sofa Cover Sectional Left Chaise Sofa Cover Couch Slipcover Furniture Protector for Kids Dogs Pets (L-Shape 3+4 Seats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wOj5VMvRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Scorpiuse 2 Pcs L-Shaped Stretch Sofa Slipcover--- Protect your furniture from daily stains, tear, wear and scratch. This L-shaped sofa cover has two pieces, one for the chaise and the other one for the main sofa. 2 PIECE / SET This item is 2 pieces, fit for L shape sofa combined by 2 parts separately. The chaise is on the left side of the main sofa (when facing your sofa). Please measure your sofa size before purchase and choose the right size. PREMIUM MATERIAL Made of 95% polyester fiber+ 5% spandex which is soft, elastic, easy to stretch. Protect your sofa from spills, stains, and tears, while still add luxurious and charming looking. Gives your SOFA a new look. EASY CARE It's super easy to install and remove for cleaning. Machine washable for easy care and maintenance, clean with cold water and mild detergent and air drying or Low-temperature drying. Please do not use bleach and iron. SIZE 2 Seater: Sofa length 57\"-72\" (145-185cm) 3 Seater: Sofa length 75\"-90\"(190-230cm) 4 Seater: Sofa length 90\"-118\"(230-300cm) It is a sofa cover specially designed for a sectional sofa. Please choose the right size for your sectional sofa.  Package Includes 2x Sofa covers Multiple anti-slip strips (Tuck the excess fabric into the gap of the cushion, put the foam pieces inside to prevent sliding off.) It is a sofa cover specially designed for a sectional sofa. Please choose the right size for your sectional sofa. Package Includes 2x Sofa covers Multiple anti-slip strips (Tuck the excess fabric into the gap of the cushion, put the foam pieces inside to prevent sliding off.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wOj5VMvRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scorpiuse","source_asin":"B083FRN4MK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083FRN4MK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083FRN4MK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":624926,"name":"Salt & York - Wooden Tongs - Salad Tongs - 9 Inch Tongs - Set of 1 (Olive)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C8Bek6QiL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Wood: Our tongs are crafted from high-quality, sustainably sourced hardwood ( Forest Stewardship Council–certified forests) , ensuring durability and long-lasting performance. The smooth finish not only adds an elegant touch to your kitchen but also prevents any scratching or damage to your cookware. Safe and Gentle: With our wooden tongs, you can confidently handle hot foods without worrying about melting or harmful chemicals leaching into your meals. The natural wood construction acts as an excellent heat insulator, keeping your hands protected while serving or flipping food. Multi-Purpose Design: Our tongs are a versatile tool for a wide range of culinary tasks. Use them for effortlessly flipping steaks, sautéing vegetables, tossing salads, serving pasta, or even grilling delicate seafood. The sturdy and ergonomic design ensures a secure grip, making cooking a breeze. Gentle on Non-Stick Surfaces: The smooth wooden surface of our tongs prevents scratches and damage to non-stick pans and delicate cookware. You can confidently use them without worrying about ruining your favorite pots and pans, making them an essential tool in any kitchen. Easy to Use and Maintain: These tongs feature a spring mechanism that provides precise control and effortless operation. The hinge allows for smooth opening and closing, ensuring a reliable grip on your food. Handles lock for storage. Cleaning is a breeze too – simply hand wash with mild soap and water, and let them air dry. Eco-Friendly Choice: By choosing our wooden tongs, you're making an environmentally conscious decision. Our tongs are made from sustainable materials, reducing your carbon footprint while enjoying the benefits of a reliable kitchen tool. Stylish and Functional: The natural wood finish adds a touch of elegance to your kitchen decor. Whether you have a modern or rustic kitchen, these tongs will seamlessly blend in and become a stylish addition to your cooking utensil collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C8Bek6QiL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BSVKL2MN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSVKL2MN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSVKL2MN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
