window.products.push({"id":624963,"name":"Tea Strainer For Loose Leaf Tea, Stainless Steel Extra Fine Mesh Tea Strainers Tea Infuser, Tea Filter Tea Steeper Ideal For Loose Tea Leaves, Herbel,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yCldp29dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE CAPACITY LOOSE TEA STRAINER : Our loose tea steeper has a larger capacity than other loose leaf tea infusers, allowing for more water flow, full steeping brewing, and full expansion of the tea leaves without compromising the infusion.2.95 inches, easy to hold 4 tablespoons of tea, suitable for making a large amount of tea at once. Ideal for entertaining friends, outdoor preparation, etc. 403 STAINLESS STEEL TEA BASKET: The tea diffusers for loose tea are made from high-quality food grade 403 stainless steel, which is chemical-free, durable, rust-free, odor free, long-lasting, and won't crack or shatter. Easy to clean and dishwasher safe. The metal tea infuser is lightweight and fits in your camping bag, rucksack, etc. Easy to travel with and can be used on many occasions. MULTIFUNCTIONAL LID AND WIDE SIDE-HOLDER: This stainless steel tea strainer lid helps to retain the heat and flavor of the tea during the brewing process. The reusable tea infuser lid can also be used as a water tray to prevent the table from getting wet. The two wide side holders for the stainless steel tea infuser make it easy to insert and remove the fine tea infuser. The long handle means the mesh tea strainer fits most cups, mugs, glasses, teacups, teapots, and travel mugs. EXTRA FINE MESH TEA STRAINERS FOR LOOSE TEA: The tea diffusers for loose tea is designed with ultra-fine mesh holes to completely preserve the integrity of the tea leaves, granules, or powder while allowing the aroma to waft out. As a result, the large number of holes allows the water to flow more freely and the tea leaves will not leak out of the tea strainer during brewing. This tea leaf strainer for loose tea can accurately brew a wide range of teas, from large to small, not only for loose te REUSABLE TEA INFUSER AND MORE ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY: Making tea with a tea holder for loose tea is much better than teabags. The use of a fine mesh tea infuser to make the tea can be reused, is more environmentally friendly, has higher nutritional value, and tastes better. At this time, if you need a reliable loose tea steeper, LISA ENJOYMENT tea strainers & filters will be your best choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yCldp29dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LISA ENJOYMENT","source_asin":"B0B9BGMS1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-624963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BGMS1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BGMS1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
